{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "113", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "That wraps up a match that no one could have predicted. Pakistan might have had the home advantage but West Indies were the favourites with the white ball. The two sides will meet again tomorrow at 2130 IST for the 2nd T20I, giving the tourists a chance to come back hard and even the scores. Do join us then for the action. Until then, goodbye and take care!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "112", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan captain, Sarfraz Ahmed thanks Almighty first and he's happy with his players' performance. Feels body language is important and he tries to motivate the players. Credits all his bowlers as they supported Imad Wasim who always gives the early breakthrough whenever they need it. Adds if you want to compete, irrespective of the opposition then you have to take wickets.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "111", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "West Indies captain, Carlos Brathwaite feels his side didn't get off to a good start. Says they will analyze this game and check what went wrong individually. Adds defending 115 is very difficult but they fought hard and will come back tomorrow with a better performance.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "110", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Match, Imad Wasim says he just gave his 100 percent. Adds when he was young playing domestic cricket, his attitude was right and he just wanted to play for his country one day.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "109", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The heat seemed to get the better of the tourists in the second half but they didn't do much better in the first either. Dwayne Bravo was their saving grace, dragging the team's total over the 100-run line, with Jerome Taylor as his unlikely partner. Key to their collapse was a fearsome Imad Wasim, who picked up a fifer, the first Pakistani spinner to do so in T20Is.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "108", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "If Pakistan looked completely in their element, the same could not be said of the West Indies. Lackadaisical and lacklustre, their performance on the field left a lot to be desired. No matter what the bowlers threw at the batsmen, they couldn't hold back the runs. Samuel Badree picked up the lone wicket but it was not enough under the pressure of the scoreboard.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "107", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Sharjeel Khan got Pakistan off to a flyer but was dismissed before he could really get into his element. Latif stayed on with Azam, who scored his maiden half-century, and the pair racked up a match-winning stand of 88 runs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "106", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Short and sweet is how Pakistan did it. They have wrapped up the game with 9 wickets in hand once more. This time they have done it with 34 balls remaining and are asserting a completely new T20I side. It was Azam and Latif who took the hosts across the line, cruising through the Windies bowlers with ease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.2", "Id": "105", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "FOUR! THAT WILL DO! PAKISTAN WIN BY 9 WICKETS! Length ball wide outside off, Azam slams it over the cover region and gets back-to-back boundaries and that's Pakistan's back-to-back 9-wicket win too! PAKISTAN GO 1-0 UP IN THE 3-MATCH SERIES!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "104", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Maiden T20I fifty for Babar Azam!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "14.1", "Id": "103", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "FOUR! Poor fielding by Bravo! Sums up West Indies' performance today! Short of a length ball outside off, Azam cuts it towards third man where Bravo fails to stop the ball and concedes a boundary. That brings up Azam's fifty too. Fine knock!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "102", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Brathwaite is back on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.6", "Id": "101", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Around off, Latif defends it with soft hands.", "Summary": {"Score": "108/1", "Over": "14", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3985", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "34", "Balls": "32", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "59429", "Runs": "47", "Balls": "35", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "21", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.5", "Id": "100", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "SIX! Hugggeee hit! On middle and off, Latif smokes it over wide long on for a huge biggie. Pakistan inch closer!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.4", "Id": "99", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Tossed up around off, Latif defends it back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.3", "Id": "98", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Tad short outside off, Latif cuts it late towards third man. The short third man fielder puts in a lazy dive and the batsman gets a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.2", "Id": "97", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Shortish outside off, Azam cuts it through the point region off his back foot for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.1", "Id": "96", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Landed outside off, Azam mistimes it back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Narine is back on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.6", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "The batsman plays the pull-shot. They pick up a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "97/1", "Over": "13", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "46", "Balls": "33", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "24", "Balls": "28", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3556", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.5", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Length ball on the stumps, Latif connects well this time, pulling it through square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Bouncer! Latif looks to pull this short delivery but plays it too late and the ball is deflected off his gloves to third man.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "FOUR! Well struck! Full length delivery outside off, driven down the ground. It is a safe shot, knowing the fielder is at mid off and the ball goes down the ground for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Fuller ball on middle, worked down the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3556", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "FOUR! LOFTED! Full toss outside off, powered over the mid-wicket fielder and the races races across the ropes.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Shortish ball outside off, cut through the covers for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "86/1", "Over": "12", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "40", "Balls": "30", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "19", "Balls": "25", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3910", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Back of a length ball angled on middle and leg, pulled to the man at square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Overpitched ball on off, driven through the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Short of a length ball landed just outside off, Latif pulls it towards mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "The batsman has punched the ball off the back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "WIDE! Way down the leg side, Latif lets it go through. The umpire takes his time to signal a wide.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Length ball around off, slower one, Azam pushes it to the off side for a quick run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Tossed up on the stumps, flicked away with a wristy shot for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "80/1", "Over": "11", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "37", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "17", "Balls": "22", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Full around off, driven towards mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "50-run partnership between Latif and Azam.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "FOUR! MISFIELDED! Was it the heat? Full on off, driven past the bowler and through mid on. Powell bends low to stop it but does not look sharp while doing so and the ball passes through his hands and goes behind for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Full outside off, driven to mid off for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Flighted on middle and off, nudged through mid-wicket for a single. Babar Azam's strike rate is 140.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Straighter ball on off, whipped through mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Narine is back on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Fuller ball on middle, worked to square leg for a single. 8 runs from that over.", "Summary": {"Score": "71/1", "Over": "10", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "34", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "11", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3910", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Full outside off, driven back to the bowler. Pollard hurls the ball back at the batsman. Can only imagine WI's frustration.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "FOUR! Cleverly done! Babar Azam is looking at ease in his batting. Shorter ball around off, he knows exactly where the fielder is and knocks it just past for a boundary at third man.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Full outside off, driven through mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Full ball on middle and leg, flicked to mid-wicket for a single. Pakistan in cruise control now, picking up the runs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3910", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Slow and fuller ball outside off, pushed across to mid on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Kieron Pollard is brought into the attack!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "SIX! Bye bye ball! A full ball around middle and off, Azam swings it into oblivion over mid-wicket! 19 from the over!", "Summary": {"Score": "63/1", "Over": "9", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "28", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "9", "Balls": "17", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "56973", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "21", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "FREE HIT TIME!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "5", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "nb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "NO BALL! FOUR! The dew getting the better of the West Indians out there. Brathwaite loses control of the ball and delivers a high full toss around middle and leg. Azam whips it over square leg and gets a boundary!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Outside off, a play and a miss this time as Babar tries to push it through the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "SIX! CATCHING OPPORTUNITY MISSED! Poor effort from Jerome Taylor. A short ball around middle, Azam pulls it straight to Taylor at long leg. The fielder however misjudges it and the ball goes between his hands and crosses the ropes!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "LEADING EDGE, SAFE! Full on middle, Latif looks to flick but gets a leading edge which goes wide of cover. A single taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Landed outside off, dabbed to third man for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Outside off, punched