ed short around off, Azam heaves it wide of long on. Pollard runs to his right and dives full stretch to stop the ball. Two runs taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "9797", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Short and outside off, punched back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "There is plenty of dew on the outfield. Badree is struggling big time. There is some delay as the towels are out to clean the ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "9797", "Batsman": "3985", "Commentary": "Landed outside off, punched down to long on for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "59429", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, played straight to point.", "Summary": {"Score": "40/1", "Over": "7", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59429", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3985", "Runs": "7", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "56973", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "2", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "49", "UID": nu